Relax: It helps us relax and reduce stress after studying or working. Besides, it also helps us feel comfortable, so we can improve emotions. Finally, we can refresh our minds and feel happy.

Knowledge: It helps us widen knowledge and learn many useful things such as new information, skills, experiences, ideas (cultures, traditions, customs, habits, languages, styles, and so on). When we have knowledge, we can make good choices in life. We can also discover a lot of new things, so it is very valuable for our jobs in the future.

Friends: It helps us meet new people and join inte activities. They can help us at work, make us feel happy and relaxed. In the future, friends will help us have better social relationships and improve our life. To sum up, I think friendship is very important in life.

Health: It helps us stay well and not get sick. It keeps our body and mind strong. It stops problems like heart or eye problems. Good health also helps us study and work better, do activities, and feel happy. In the future, it will make our life better.

Money: It helps us save money and avoid waste. When we have money, we can buy many things we like, go to the places we want, and help poor people. It also helps us use money in a good way. In my opinion, money is valuable.

Skills: It helps us improve communication, teamwork, and problem solving. We can use these skills in study, work, and daily life. In the future, they will help us get good jobs with a high salary and have many amazing ideas.

Time: It helps us save time, so we will have more time to do other things. For example, we can play football, play video games, learning many things, and go out with friends. We go home to visit our family and neighbors. It is also important because it helps us work or study better and relax.







